WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.132 --> 00:00:08.925
Come on, throw me one!

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:13.054
I'll hit your pathetic pitch with my bat
and score a home run!

00:00:14.431 --> 00:00:15.890
Dammit!

00:00:15.974 --> 00:00:18.059
This is so embarrassing, I'd rather die.

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:20.395
But I've got no choice.

00:00:20.979 --> 00:00:25.358
As long as I'm the batter,
that Mask won't be able to hit me!

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:30.280
Don't tell me this is a dead ball!

00:00:41.958 --> 00:00:43.710
An impressive strike.

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:46.296
My thoughts were right!

00:00:47.464 --> 00:00:49.799
There's no reason to be afraid now!

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:54.596
-Okihara!
-Yes!

00:01:10.195 --> 00:01:11.488
Honjo!

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:14.949
At your level, there's no chance.

00:01:15.825 --> 00:01:16.743
What?

00:01:17.368 --> 00:01:20.455
At your level, you won't be able to become

00:01:21.206 --> 00:01:22.916
God of this realm.

00:01:32.217 --> 00:01:33.218
Well done.

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:37.055
You utilized the pre-Mask nature
of this human.

00:01:37.138 --> 00:01:39.349
"Realm"? "God"?

00:01:40.058 --> 00:01:41.935
What the heck is he talking about?

00:01:42.018 --> 00:01:45.313
But if you're already struggling with me,

00:01:45.396 --> 00:01:47.357
you're far from being God.

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:50.610
Does he know
a crucial secret about this world?

00:01:55.657 --> 00:01:59.077
I'm glad I got to play baseball
in the end.

00:02:08.253 --> 00:02:09.671
Hey, Honjo.

00:02:10.255 --> 00:02:12.257
Was I not supposed to shoot him?

00:02:12.757 --> 00:02:14.634
No, don't worry.

00:02:15.135 --> 00:02:16.719
You did great, Okihara.

00:02:18.263 --> 00:02:22.934
At your level, you won't be able to
become God of this realm.

00:02:23.518 --> 00:02:25.311
What does "become God" mean?

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:29.149
I assumed the goal of this world
was to get to the helicopter,

00:02:29.274 --> 00:02:31.359
but is there a different objective?

00:02:31.442 --> 00:02:34.362
Are you okay, Honjo?

00:02:34.445 --> 00:02:36.072
Now's not the time to think.

00:02:36.781 --> 00:02:39.576
Okihara, let's head back for now.

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:40.994
Yes.

00:02:41.077 --> 00:02:43.329
The mention of "God" bothers me.

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:47.292
I better be more concerned about
the "realm" right now.

